    "created_at": "2016-07-13T05:37:04Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-07-13T05:37:04Z",
    "body": "Here's the way I see it: if you managed to load the font such that you can use it, that means that you can load the font file using XHR (because font loads are already subject to CORS).  At that point, you can just extract glyph information from it yourself so there is no meaningful security thing going on here.\n\nAm I missing something?\n",
