    "updated_at": "2016-07-13T19:22:52Z",
    "body": "If https://developer.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-edge/platform/status/crossdomainfontloading means what I think it means, I guess fonts are not subject to CORS in Safari and Mobile IE? It looks like Chrome made them subject to CORS [in Chrome 37](https://bugs.chromium.org/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=286681). Hmm.\n",
