    "created_at": "2016-07-13T19:29:27Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-07-13T19:29:27Z",
    "body": "I'm not sure what the status of this stuff  is in IE.  Safari has long resisted implementing the CORS stuff there.  I agree that UAs that don't follow the CSS spec for `@font-face` may need an extra mechanism to prevent leaking information via canvas.  The ones that do follow the CSS spec don't need that.\n",
